  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-09T19:55:56.097810Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T08:56:01.571687Z",
  "totalBlocks": 82,
  "translatedBlocks": 82,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "80f921dc9023261e",
      "translationZh": "人工智能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "041396d82126f799",
      "translationZh": "将 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 连接到跨账户知识库",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9662d920b53ed3ba",
      "translationZh": "组织经常使用 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 部署智能体。该平台支持使用任意框架或模型，大规模构建、连接和优化智能体。这些智能体可能会访问托管在不同 AWS 账户中的、受治理的知识库。这种跨账户隔离有助于维持清晰的工作负载边界，但也可能带来集成挑战。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bdc91a1405f4dd4b",
      "translationZh": "本文介绍一个账户中的 AgentCore 智能体如何在不复制源数据的情况下，利用另一个账户中由 Amazon Redshift Serverless 提供底层支持的知识库生成答案。该知识库使用 Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases，这是一项完全托管的检索增强生成能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f93687ff71760bf",
      "translationZh": "本文涵盖两种已正式推出的 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 编排模式的架构、安全边界、请求流程和选择标准。链接中的 GitHub 示例提供了这两种方案的部署步骤和实现细节：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8f46dd74a0b87254",
      "translationZh": "在 AgentCore runtime 上运行的、基于代码的 Strands 智能体；AgentCore runtime 是 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一项能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0cb539084bc0150d",
      "translationZh": "声明式 AgentCore harness，这是 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一项能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "14f44f702070c071",
      "translationZh": "使用 Amazon Bedrock 构建 AI 智能体的组织可以在 Amazon Redshift Serverless 中维护结构化数据。这些数据存储库可以位于与其 AI 智能体不同的 AWS 账户中。Amazon Bedrock Knowledge Bases 资源策略支持通过 Retrieve 和 GetDocumentContent 执行跨账户操作。受支持的资源策略操作不包括 RetrieveAndGenerate。由于此解决方案需要 RetrieveAndGenerate 返回生成的答案，因此工具会在调用 API 之前，代入知识库账户中一个权限范围严格限定的 AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) 角色。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "14694d2780882199",
      "translationZh": "这给采用多账户架构、希望实现以下目标的企业带来了挑战：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "485315b4c5a477cc",
      "translationZh": "针对 Amazon Redshift Serverless 中的结构化数据生成自然语言回答。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c0babedf848d8846",
      "translationZh": "在智能体工作负载与数据工作负载之间维持账户边界。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cc01795bde377c3d",
      "translationZh": "避免将受治理的源数据复制到智能体账户中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1532f51d995f0596",
      "translationZh": "通过专用的跨账户 IAM 角色授予最小权限访问。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "67b0d5bdab09f988",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案以两种方式实现跨账户查询模式。变体 1 将 Strands 智能体部署到 AgentCore 运行时。变体 2 使用声明式 AgentCore 执行框架。两种实现使用相同的数据访问边界。由模型控制的工具通过 AWS Security Token Service (AWS STS) 代入 Knowledge Base 访问角色，调用 RetrieveAndGenerate，并将生成的回答和引用返回给编排层。这两种变体的区别在于由谁负责智能体循环，以及工具如何托管。图 1 对比了这两条编排路径及其共享的跨账户数据访问边界。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d01d9638adbe455",
      "translationZh": "图 1：并排对比的 AgentCore 实现路径",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "707f1c1237c95057",
      "translationZh": "请求按以下顺序执行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2fa2582c0595812e",
      "translationZh": "用户通过 Streamlit UI 或 AgentCore API 提交自然语言问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "25dd0dc43107cbf3",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Nova Pro 决定调用 query_knowledge_base 工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8c05b2cf85966028",
      "translationZh": "在变体 1 中，该工具在与 AgentCore runtime 一同打包的本地 Model Context Protocol (MCP) 子进程中运行。在变体 2 中，AgentCore 执行框架通过 AgentCore Gateway 调用 AWS Lambda 工具，AgentCore Gateway 是 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一项功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b107a215be06ef04",
      "translationZh": "该工具使用 AWS STS 代入 Knowledge Base 账户中的 bedrock_kb_access_role 角色。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a878b85d5aac92cd",
      "translationZh": "代入角色后的会话使用 Claude Haiku 4.5 调用 RetrieveAndGenerate。Knowledge Base 将该问题转换为针对 Amazon Redshift Serverless 的结构化查询。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "67529c4ddf27b035",
      "translationZh": "生成的答案通过所选的编排路径返回给用户。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f762421b10111bc",
      "translationZh": "图 2 展示了基于代码的 Strands 智能体的请求路径。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "683c00464d97edcd",
      "translationZh": "图 2：基于代码的 Strands 智能体架构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7c6307aa62fb311",
      "translationZh": "图 3 展示了声明式 AgentCore 执行框架对应的托管路径。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b2ee43dbce85831",
      "translationZh": "图 3：声明式 AgentCore 执行框架架构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "039a4d60e70782b8",
      "translationZh": "选择能满足需求的最简单模式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5852105e168c7e1e",
      "translationZh": "在选择智能体实现方式之前，先确定工作负载是否真的需要智能体。这可以让设计的复杂度与所需行为相匹配。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "93a3b98164f59633",
      "translationZh": "如果应用程序只需要检索到的内容，请评估结合 Knowledge Base 资源策略使用原生跨账户 Retrieve 的方案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "68274a70e8c412c8",
      "translationZh": "如果每个请求都确定需要一个生成的答案，请先确认工作负载是否不需要工具选择、多步推理或对话状态。如果确实不需要，请代入 Knowledge Base 所在账户的角色，并直接从应用程序或 AWS Lambda 函数调用 RetrieveAndGenerate。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "959ada192a8768c8",
      "translationZh": "当模型必须在更广泛的对话或使用工具的工作流中决定何时或如何查询 Knowledge Base 时，请使用智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "50b8c956f1dadcb7",
      "translationZh": "何时使用各个 AgentCore 变体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d6f06a0965714b7",
      "translationZh": "跨账户要求并不偏向任何一种方案。应根据团队需要定制和运维编排循环的程度来选择。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6fa8a268c939c7ff",
      "translationZh": "基于代码的 Strands 智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3dc299f5717e8cb",
      "translationZh": "声明式 AgentCore 执行框架",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "be00943f420b3050",
      "translationZh": "需要自定义编排、钩子、中间件、重试行为、可观测性埋点，或需要直接控制工具和流式传输的团队。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16fa7d29b058fdd5",
      "translationZh": "用例适合托管循环、且偏好配置优先生命周期的团队。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "606edc1eb74faac8",
      "translationZh": "你的 Python 代码使用 Strands Agents SDK 运行该循环。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69d24cdd81229814",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore 根据执行框架定义运行该循环。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a46fbf0c69284234",
      "translationZh": "从 AgentCore 运行时到本地 MCP 子进程，再到 Knowledge Base。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4431b2e2cb52e09",
      "translationZh": "从 AgentCore 运行框架到 AgentCore Gateway，再到 AWS Lambda，最后到 Knowledge Base。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e31337c8f9ad22d6",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore 运行时执行角色。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d68cade9dc690db7",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore Gateway 后端的 AWS Lambda 执行角色。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ebbbcd431f2dbbd3",
      "translationZh": "agent.py、依赖项、MCP 服务器、工具逻辑和运行时配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb94d0b46ef60ff0",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore 运行框架配置、系统提示词、AWS Lambda 工具、IAM 和应用行为。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a20bb688a692ce3",
      "translationZh": "需要在自定义控制与托管编排之间做出选择。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "68bdb65abc1c6177",
      "translationZh": "开始之前，请确认你已满足以下先决条件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "48d47899b433a0b3",
      "translationZh": "两个 AWS 账户：一个 agent 账户和一个 agent-kb 账户。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c4c8b9052893e340",
      "translationZh": "AWS Command Line Interface (AWS CLI) v2.24.22 或更高版本，并具备两个账户的凭证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "711b4399c739ec2f",
      "translationZh": "Python 3.10 或更高版本，以及 jq。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a1185edb2d4028f7",
      "translationZh": "连接到 Amazon Redshift Serverless 的结构化 Amazon Bedrock 知识库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "24176e265a39f28a",
      "translationZh": "在美国西部（俄勒冈）区域拥有模型访问权限：agent 账户中的 us.amazon.nova-pro-v1:0，以及 agent-kb 账户中的 us.anthropic.claude-haiku-4-5-20251001-v1:0。有关各区域的模型可用性，请参阅 Amazon Bedrock 中的“按 AWS 区域划分的受支持模型”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2095a65e35481a56",
      "translationZh": "对于 harness 变体，除了基于代码的变体所使用的 Python bedrock-agentcore CLI 之外，还需安装当前版本的 @aws/agentcore Node.js CLI。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "730d62da54a8ddd6",
      "translationZh": "这些示例使用以下本地配置文件别名和占位账户 ID：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "57025eba2e8ce951",
      "translationZh": "承载 AgentCore 资源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7362abc7dd4b6c41",
      "translationZh": "承载知识库和 Redshift Serverless。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe7333f150f22bc3",
      "translationZh": "这些示例使用美国西部（俄勒冈）区域（us-west-2）。配置文件名称是本地别名，因此请将其替换为您已配置的配置文件名称，并通过查询获取账户 ID，而不是将其硬编码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "327cdaa733e62fbd",
      "translationZh": "实施步骤详解",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "56bc967d8ae04cd3",
      "translationZh": "本文重点介绍架构和决策指导。部署流程在公开的 GitHub 示例中维护。请按照“实施步骤详解”准备结构化知识库、跨账户 IAM 角色以及 AgentCore memory（Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的一项功能）。然后，对于基于代码的 Strands 变体，请按照“运行智能体”操作；对于托管式智能体循环，请按照“变体 2——声明式编排框架”操作。该示例还包含用于 Local、AgentCore 和 Harness UI 模式的 Streamlit 端到端客户端。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc58ad86baf7660b",
      "translationZh": "比较不同变体时，请使用相同的问题、知识库 ID、模型、检索数量，以及全新的会话。提示词约定要求两个智能体将用户的问题原样传递给工具，但 RetrieveAndGenerate 仍具有生成性质。对于行级问题，请指定行数、日期范围和排序顺序。未设定边界的生成 SQL 可能超出结果处理限制。请对照工具的直接响应和底层结构化数据验证业务事实。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d426ca72a1643809",
      "translationZh": "在 Streamlit 客户端中，比较结果之前，请先选择调用模式。对于 AgentCore 或 Harness 模式，请确认已填入相应已部署资源的 Amazon Resource Name（ARN）。每次进行独立的事实比较时，都应开始一个新对话。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00d95acba1fad782",
      "translationZh": "图 4：在 Streamlit 侧边栏中选择 Local、AgentCore 或 Harness",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46315f16976d595d",
      "translationZh": "图 5 展示了 Harness 模式下一个成功执行的有界查询。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "54e70abbf0651476",
      "translationZh": "图 5：Harness 模式，已填入部署资源的 ARN，并成功执行了有界查询",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ff71888e16cca9d",
      "translationZh": "针对 TPC-H 数据集的示例问题包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "65c085f690450f5a",
      "translationZh": "沙特阿拉伯排名前 5 的客户是谁？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bd902ce6814bfe93",
      "translationZh": "按供应量计算，美国排名靠前的零部件供应商有哪些？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9081dba5f613d43d",
      "translationZh": "1998 年各地区的总收入是多少？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "77ca9dcff56f006b",
      "translationZh": "哪些产品在折扣后产生的收入最高？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f1cc4876b6ccba32",
      "translationZh": "显示 1997 年 10 月 1 日至 12 月 31 日期间标记为 1-URGENT、订单金额最高的 100 笔订单。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "064bb9f1a8f747e1",
      "translationZh": "推荐实践",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce11fd69f065d513",
      "translationZh": "部署和验证任一变体时，请采用以下实践：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "06f7e1acc20fc491",
      "translationZh": "在进行独立的事实比较时，使用新的会话 ID。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c5b7f6af8339e62a",
      "translationZh": "记录准确的工具查询、Knowledge Base ID、模型 ID 和检索结果数量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a3ff13e835160042",
      "translationZh": "使用经过批准的精选 SQL 和列描述来定义派生业务指标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "967491b35756dc35",
      "translationZh": "通过明确的行数、日期范围和排序顺序来限定行级问题，避免 SQL 结果集过大。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9dbbcbcd89115dd7",
      "translationZh": "将跨账户角色的权限范围限定在所需的 Knowledge Base 和模型资源上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1bc17bda1d8aa56f",
      "translationZh": "在长期运行的运行时和保持热状态的 AWS Lambda 环境中，使用可刷新的 STS 凭证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f66a9be07ee5f74a",
      "translationZh": "针对两种变体，测试系统提示词、工具描述、IAM 和应用程序行为。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "355cd5e173c7d210",
      "translationZh": "应用 Amazon Bedrock Guardrails，评估用户问题和生成的答案是否包含有害内容、禁止的话题和敏感信息。Guardrails 是对最小权限访问、源数据治理、基于引用的验证以及重大决策中的人工审核的补充，但不能取代它们。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "410ccc729e4a6238",
      "translationZh": "请按照示例中的清理部分，使用最新的命令并遵循要求的执行顺序。如果两个变体都已部署，请先完成 harness 的清理，以便从共享的 Knowledge Base 访问角色中移除对其 AWS Lambda 执行角色的信任授权。然后移除基于代码的运行时和共享 IAM 资源。这些脚本不会删除由项目管理的 AgentCore memory、Knowledge Base 或 Redshift Serverless 资源。当不再需要这些资源时，请单独删除它们。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34d6677e8679a3e8",
      "translationZh": "本文介绍了 AgentCore 智能体如何跨 AWS 账户边界，从结构化的 Amazon Bedrock 知识库返回生成的答案。两种实现都使用数据账户中的最小权限角色。架构上的选择在于由谁掌控智能体循环，以及工具如何托管。如果原生 Retrieve 或直接调用 RetrieveAndGenerate 的模式能够满足工作负载需求，请优先采用这些方式。当需要由模型控制的工具或对话编排时，请选择基于代码的 Strands 变体，以实现自定义循环行为和直接控制。如果 AgentCore harness 的托管循环符合需求，并且您的团队倾向于配置优先的运营模式，则请选择它。两者都是有效且已正式发布的方案。这里提供了 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Documentation，您可以通过其中的代码示例开始使用 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
